flowchart LR
  A[Browser / System / Provider / Database / Document] --> B[Source Record Adapter]
  B --> C[Identifier + Alias Normalization]
  C --> D{company_id + type compatible?}
  D -- No --> X[Reject candidate]
  D -- Yes --> E[Candidate Retrieval]
  E --> F[Weighted Match + Conflict Detection]
  F --> G{Strong / clear match?}
  G -- Yes --> H[Attach source record to canonical entity]
  G -- Ambiguous --> I[Emit unresolved candidates]
  G -- No candidate --> J[Create provisional canonical entity]
  H --> K[Canonical Entity + Resolution Lineage]
  I --> K
  J --> K
  K -. no authority .-> L[Decision / Domain Consumers]
